# Implementation Plan - Integrate High-Fidelity User Management Screens

This plan details the integration of the User Management and Create User screens into the `UsersTab.tsx` component.

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> - **Unified Component Navigation**: We will manage the transition between the **Employee Directory** table (Screen 1) and the **Create New User** form (Screen 2) via a simple React state boolean (`isCreating`). Clicking the "Create New User" button in the directory view will display the form, and clicking "Cancel" or successfully submitting the form will return the user to the directory view.
> - **API Integration**: Form submission will call the existing `useCreateUserMutation` endpoint, and the directory view will populate using the `useGetUsersQuery` hook, with fallback mock data for high-fidelity representation of corporate profiles.

## Proposed Changes

### Users Feature Component

#### [MODIFY] [UsersTab.tsx](file:///d:/vibe%20code/spend-managment/project/frontend/src/features/users/UsersTab.tsx)
We will rewrite `UsersTab.tsx` to handle two modes based on `isCreating` state:
1. **Employee Directory (Directory Mode)**:
   - Bento-style summary stats row (Total Users, Active Now, Pending Audit, Flagged Actions).
   - Search bar and filtering badges matching Screen 1.
   - User table displaying Employee (profile avatar + name + email), System Role badge, Department, Last Activity, and Status (Active, Policy Violation, Deactivated) with hover action buttons.
   - AI Audit recommendation panel at the bottom ("3 inactive Engineering users recommendation").
2. **Create New User (Form Mode)**:
   - Full glass-panel input canvas matching Screen 2.
   - Fields: Full Name, Work Email, Employee ID, Cost Center, Manager Assignment, Department, and System Role.
   - Toggle buttons for Access Controls (MFA Required, API Access).
   - Warning banner for Compliance department verification.
   - Success toast triggers upon validation and submission.

